			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "概述"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170125-lqsz38a",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170125-lqsz38a",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "语义搜索通过比较文本向量查找含义相近的内容。普通全文搜索依赖关键词是否出现，语义搜索则可以找到措辞不同但主题相关的笔记。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170126-k37rp2l",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170126-k37rp2l",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "配置方式"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170127-mgcq0zk",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 3,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170127-mgcq0zk",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "嵌入模型"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170128-545qc2n",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170128-545qc2n",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "设置"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "人工智能"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "嵌入模型"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 中启用 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "语义搜索"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，并配置 API 基础地址、API 密钥、模型、向量维度和超时时间。配置完成后可使用连接测试确认模型是否可用。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170129-7wv1ug4",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170129-7wv1ug4",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "向量维度设为 0 时使用模型默认值。仅在目标模型支持自定义向量维度时填写其他值；修改模型或向量维度后需要重建嵌入索引。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170130-pgr9zbg",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 3,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170130-pgr9zbg",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "重排模型"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170131-cc0e92n",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170131-cc0e92n",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "重排模型为可选配置。启用后，系统会对向量召回的候选内容再次评分，以提高结果排序的准确性。候选数量越大，通常越准确，但延迟和费用也会增加。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170132-55xn41q",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170132-55xn41q",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "使用方式"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170133-c5bjsps",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170133-c5bjsps",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "打开全文搜索，在搜索菜单的 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "搜索方式"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 中选择 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "语义搜索"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，然后使用自然语言描述要查找的内容。笔记本、路径和内容块类型等过滤条件仍然有效。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170134-q71hecf",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170134-q71hecf",
				"updated": "20260820190627"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "嵌入索引"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260804170135-kphot9m",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260804170135-kphot9m",
				"updated": "20260804180000"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "启用嵌入模型后，思源会在后台为符合条件的内容块生成向量。新增或修改内容时，对应向量会自动更新。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
